This is the characters section of a theater script (any language). Extract one entry per ROLE (a script may map several roles onto one performer).

Fields per entry:
- "name": the role name exactly as printed (markdown stripped).
- "description": the role's bio/notes as printed, verbatim; "" when the section gives none.
- "actor": the performer's name when the section maps the role to one (arrow, slash, or similar notation); "" otherwise.

Rules:
- One entry per role, even when several roles share a performer.
- Copy text verbatim (markdown markers removed); never invent or embellish.

Example (invented):

Input:
```
- **Gardien \+ Le facteur → Paul**
- **Voyageuse → Jeanne** : jeune femme pressée, arrivée de nuit
```

Output JSON:
{
  "entries": [
    {"name": "Gardien", "description": "", "actor": "Paul"},
    {"name": "Le facteur", "description": "", "actor": "Paul"},
    {"name": "Voyageuse", "description": "jeune femme pressée, arrivée de nuit", "actor": "Jeanne"}
  ]
}

